{"seq":3,"slug":"computed-and-watch","title":"computed 与 watch","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/computed-and-watch","wordCount":772,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"computed-与-watch\">computed 与 watch</h1><h2 id=\"派生状态与副作用\">派生状态与副作用</h2><p>Vue 3 提供了两类响应式工具来处理数据变化：<code>computed</code> 用于创建<strong>派生状态</strong>，<code>watch</code> / <code>watchEffect</code> 用于执行<strong>副作用</strong>。理解它们的区别是高效使用 Composition API 的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Source[&quot;响应式数据源&quot;]&#10;    Source --&gt; C[&quot;computed&quot;]&#10;    Source --&gt; W[&quot;watch / watchEffect&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;派生值(缓存)&quot;]&#10;    W --&gt; E[&quot;副作用(请求/日志/DOM)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Source[\"响应式数据源\"]\n    Source --&gt; C[\"computed\"]\n    Source --&gt; W[\"watch / watchEffect\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"派生值(缓存)\"]\n    W --&gt; E[\"副作用(请求/日志/DOM)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>派生状态</strong>：由其他响应式数据计算得出的值，用 <code>computed</code> 表达，重在「结果」而非「动作」。</li>\n<li><strong>副作用</strong>：数据变化后对外部世界产生影响的操作（请求、日志、DOM），用 <code>watch</code> / <code>watchEffect</code> 表达。</li>\n<li><strong>惰性求值与缓存</strong>：<code>computed</code> 只在被访问时计算，并把结果缓存到依赖再次变化为止。</li>\n<li><strong>自动追踪 vs 显式监听</strong>：<code>watchEffect</code> 自动收集回调中访问的依赖，<code>watch</code> 需显式指定数据源并因此能拿到新旧值。</li>\n<li><strong>flush 时机</strong>：回调相对 DOM 更新执行的位置，分 <code>sync</code>、<code>pre</code>（默认）、<code>post</code> 三种。</li>\n<li><strong>onCleanup</strong>：在副作用重跑前清理上一次的异步操作，防止竞态。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"computed-详解\">computed 详解</h2><h3 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h3><p><code>computed</code> 接收一个 getter 函数，返回一个只读的 ref。它具有<strong>惰性求值</strong>和<strong>缓存</strong>特性——只有在依赖变化时才重新计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ref, computed } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const price = ref&lt;number&gt;(100);&#10;const quantity = ref&lt;number&gt;(3);&#10;const discount = ref&lt;number&gt;(0.8);&#10;&#10;const total = computed&lt;number&gt;(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;重新计算 total&#39;);&#10;  return price.value * quantity.value * discount.value;&#10;});&#10;&#10;console.log(total.value); // 240，触发计算&#10;console.log(total.value); // 240，使用缓存，不重新计算&#10;quantity.value = 5; // 标记为脏&#10;console.log(total.value); // 400，重新计算\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref, computed } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> quantity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> discount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'重新计算 total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quantity.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> discount.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 240，触发计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 240，使用缓存，不重新计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quantity.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 标记为脏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 400，重新计算</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"可写-computed\">可写 computed</h3><p>通过提供 getter 和 setter，可以创建可写的 computed：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref, computed } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const firstName = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;张&#39;);&#10;const lastName = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;三&#39;);&#10;&#10;const fullName = computed&lt;string&gt;({&#10;  get: () =&gt; `${firstName.value}${lastName.value}`,&#10;  set: (val: string) =&gt; {&#10;    firstName.value = val[0] ?? &#39;&#39;;&#10;    lastName.value = val.slice(1);&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;input v-model=&quot;fullName&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;p&gt;姓：{{ firstName }}，名：{{ lastName }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref, computed } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const firstName = ref&#x3C;string>('张');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const lastName = ref&#x3C;string>('三');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const fullName = computed&#x3C;string>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  get: () => `${firstName.value}${lastName.value}`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  set: (val: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    firstName.value = val[0] ?? '';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lastName.value = val.slice(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;input v-model=\"fullName\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;p>姓：{{ firstName }}，名：{{ lastName }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"惰性求值与缓存机制\">惰性求值与缓存机制</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;访问 computed.value&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B{&quot;dirty 标记?&quot;}&#10;    B -- &quot;是(依赖已变化)&quot; --&gt; C[&quot;重新执行 getter&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;缓存结果,清除 dirty&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;返回新值&quot;]&#10;    B -- &quot;否(依赖未变化)&quot; --&gt; F[&quot;返回缓存值&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"访问 computed.value\"]\n    A --&gt; B{\"dirty 标记?\"}\n    B -- \"是(依赖已变化)\" --&gt; C[\"重新执行 getter\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"缓存结果,清除 dirty\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"返回新值\"]\n    B -- \"否(依赖未变化)\" --&gt; F[\"返回缓存值\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>惰性</td>\n<td>只在被访问时才计算，不会在依赖变化时立即执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>依赖不变时返回缓存值，避免重复计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动追踪</td>\n<td>getter 中访问的所有响应式数据都会被自动追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只读（默认）</td>\n<td>默认返回只读 ref，修改 <code>.value</code> 会报警告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"watch-详解\">watch 详解</h2><h3 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h3><p><code>watch</code> 用于监听一个或多个响应式数据源，在数据变化时执行回调：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ref, watch } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const searchQuery = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;watch(searchQuery, (newVal, oldVal) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(`搜索词从 &quot;${oldVal}&quot; 变为 &quot;${newVal}&quot;`);&#10;  fetchSearchResults(newVal);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref, watch } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> searchQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">watch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(searchQuery, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newVal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">oldVal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`搜索词从 \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">oldVal</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\" 变为 \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">newVal</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetchSearchResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newVal);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"监听多个源\">监听多个源</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ref, watch } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const page = ref&lt;number&gt;(1);&#10;const pageSize = ref&lt;number&gt;(2